  DTS:Description="Pre-flight environment check before the nightly batch: free space on the data, log and tempdb volumes, the size of the inbound and archive shares, and the projected growth of the largest fact loads. The thresholds are the ones the operators set after the batch filled the log volume, and a shortfall is raised loudly enough to hold the batch."
